    "description": "The WalkingPad C2 is the one to buy when storage matters more than anything else, because it folds in half as well as flat. Retailer specs list a 0.5 to 6 km/h range (about 3.7 mph), a 120 by 40 cm running surface, a 100 kg (about 220 lb) rating and a folded size of roughly 82 by 52 by 13.6 cm, small enough for a closet shelf or the space beside a bed. Reviews put its weight anywhere from 55 to 62 lb, so it is not as light as the folded size suggests. The manufacturer's listing recommends a two-hour maximum session with a 15 minute rest to let the motor cool, and that is the trade-off: the C2 suits a couple of walking blocks a day, not an eight-hour shift. Motor ratings also vary by listing (0.75 HP to 2 HP), with 1 HP brushless the figure most spec sheets give.",
    "pros": [
      "Folds in half to roughly 82 x 52 x 13.6 cm",
      "220 lb (100 kg) rating per retailer specs",
      "Speed adjusts in small steps, per reviewers",
      "Light enough to move between rooms"
    ],
    "cons": [
      "Manufacturer recommends two-hour sessions with a cool-down",
      "220 lb rating is the lowest here",
      "Reviewers report the automatic speed mode is inconsistent"
    ],
    "bottomLine": "Choose the C2 when the walking pad has to disappear completely between sessions and your walking blocks are short."
  },
  {
    "id": "urevo-spacewalk-5l",
    "name": "UREVO SpaceWalk 5L Incline Walking Pad",
    "badge": "Best With Incline",
    "category": "Auto incline to 9%, walking pad",
