    "description": "Flat walking at a desk burns fewer calories than most people expect, and the UREVO SpaceWalk 5L answers that with a motorized incline. Review sites describe nine incline levels up to about 9 percent, which adds effort without forcing you to walk faster than you can comfortably type. The weight rating is the thing to check carefully: UREVO's site, Amazon and the EU manual for this model list 400 lb, 320 lb and 136 kg (300 lb) respectively, so plan around the lowest figure until you see the rating on the box you receive. Reviewers list a weight of about 51 lb, which keeps it movable. We did not find a consistent top-speed figure for the 5L across sources, so if you want to jog occasionally, confirm that on the current listing before buying.",
