          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            The best walking pad for most desks is the <strong class="text-white">WalkingPad Z1</strong>: a long enough belt, a sensible weight rating and a fold that makes it disappear between workdays. If you will walk for hours every day, the <strong class="text-white">LifeSpan TR1200-GlowUp</strong> is built for exactly that, and the <strong class="text-white">WalkingPad C2</strong> is the answer when storage space is the real constraint.
          </p>
